{"ref":"BDB, שַׂלְמָה²","hw":"שַׂלְמָה²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂלְמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.id.(</strong>transp. from <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְלָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:8\" href=\"/Exodus.22.8\">Ex 22:8</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂלְמַת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:25\" href=\"/Exodus.22.25\">25</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂלְמָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.13\">Dt 24:13</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂלָמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">Jos 9:5</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂלְמֹתֵיהֶם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:13\" href=\"/Joshua.9.13\">13</a>, etc.;—<em>garment</em> (of man or [<a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.11\">Ct 4:11</a>] woman): <em>outer garment</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:8\" href=\"/Exodus.22.8\">Ex 22:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:25\" href=\"/Exodus.22.25\">25</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">Jos 9:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:13\" href=\"/Joshua.9.13\">13</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.13\">Dt 24:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.29\">1 K 11:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.30\">30</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:2\" href=\"/Psalms.104.2\">ψ 104:2</a> (fig.); in gen. <em>clothes</em> (pl.) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.4\">Dt 29:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.21\">Ne 9:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 9:31\" href=\"/Job.9.31\">Jb 9:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.11\">Ct 4:11</a>; as costly gifts <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.25\">1 K 10:25</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.24\">2 Ch 9:24</a>; as booty <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:8\" href=\"/Joshua.22.8\">Jos 22:8</a> (late).—<a data-ref=\"Micah 2:8\" href=\"/Micah.2.8\">Mi 2:8</a> read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁלְמֹה</span> (Roorda, RS<sup>Proph. vii. N. 4</sup>), or <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁלְמִים</span> (We Now GASm), <em>him</em> (<em>those</em>) <em>at pease</em> (<em>with him</em>), cf. 𝔊𝔖.","next":"BDB, שׂמלי","prev":"BDB, שַׂמְלָה"}